# Cloudflare Access 로그인은 브라우저에서 admin 호스트 접근 시 수행됩니다.
# HTTP Client에서는 유효한 Access application JWT를 직접 입력합니다.
@accessJwt = replace-with-cloudflare-access-jwt

### 월간 비용 대시보드
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/v1/external-api-costs/dashboard?month=2026-08
Cf-Access-Jwt-Assertion: {{accessJwt}}

### 기간별 사용량
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/v1/external-api-costs/usage?from=2026-08-01T00:00:00Z&to=2026-09-01T00:00:00Z
Cf-Access-Jwt-Assertion: {{accessJwt}}

### 단가 및 예산 정책
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/v1/external-api-costs/policies
Cf-Access-Jwt-Assertion: {{accessJwt}}

### Google Places Text Search 단가 설정
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/v1/external-api-costs/prices/google-places/text-search-enterprise
Cf-Access-Jwt-Assertion: {{accessJwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unitPriceKrw": 30000,
  "unitSize": 1000,
  "enabled": true
}

### Google Places 월간 예산 및 차단 설정
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/v1/external-api-costs/budgets/google-places
Cf-Access-Jwt-Assertion: {{accessJwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "monthlyBudgetKrw": 100000,
  "mode": "BLOCK",
  "enabled": true
}
